			(description "GlobTek identifies YL4 as the KPPX-4P connector type and the exact PSU2 drawing assigns only pin 1 +24 V and pin 3 return/shield; pins 2 and 4 are N/C. Kycon recommends KPJX-PM-4S for KPPX plugs. GlobTek still permits a connector 'or equal', so received plug identity, keyed plug/jack view, fit, continuity and polarity remain mandatory. No N/C pin may be repurposed.")
