					(name "Evidence") "Official product PDF generated 2026-08-04; data-maintenance date 2026-04-01. Circuit diagram identifies A1/A2, 11-12-14 and 21-22-24; 24 VDC, 18 mA typical, 8 ms pickup, 10 ms release.")
